# Biome 1, level 14 — Confluence
#
# Two springs, one hub, and the hub is the only place either of them can go. A hub serves every
# spring that reaches it, so this is the first board where two routes are paid for arriving at the
# same cell from opposite sides.
#
# The line is nine cells long and straight, so the bends in the bag are the waste this time — the
# mirror of level 12, where the straights were.

